---
title: "borrow (Current Finance - Pebble Protocol Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: app.ensure_version_matches()
    q_validate --> q_check_market: app.validate_market(market)
    q_check_market --> q_check_circuit: assert(!market.has_circuit_break_triggered())
    q_check_circuit --> q_error: circuit break triggered
    q_check_circuit --> q_timestamp: now = clock.timestamp_ms() / 1000
    q_timestamp --> q_handle_borrow: market.handle_borrow(obligation_id, borrow_amount, decimals_registry, x_oracle, clock, now)
    q_handle_borrow --> q_check_health: check obligation health factor after borrow
    q_check_health --> q_error_undercollateral: risk level >= 1
    q_check_health --> q_check_emode: verify asset is in obligation's emode group
    q_check_emode --> q_error_emode: asset not in emode
    q_check_emode --> q_accrue_interest: accrue interest on reserve
    q_accrue_interest --> q_update_debt: obligation.try_borrow_asset(amount, borrow_index)
    q_update_debt --> q_enforce_min: enforce_post_borrow_repay_invariant(min_borrow_amount)
    q_enforce_min --> q_update_miner: miner.update_obligation_reward_manager(borrow_type, obligation_id, total_borrow.floor(), clock)
    q_update_miner --> q_emit: emit BorrowEvent
    q_emit --> q_transfer: coin.from_balance(borrowed_balance, ctx)
    q_transfer --> [*]: return Coin

    note right of q_handle_borrow
        INV-001: Only assets from obligation's emode group can be borrowed
        INV-002: Borrow index always monotonically increases
        INV-003: Borrowing a collateral asset is forbidden (would corrupt bookkeeping)
    end note

    note right of q_check_health
        INV-004: Risk level = total_debt_value / total_collateral_value must be < 1 after borrow
        INV-005: Oracle price must pass EMA/spot diff tolerance check
        INV-006: min_borrow_amount enforced after each borrow to prevent dust positions
    end note
